@employees_host = http://localhost:5001
@time_loggers_host = http://localhost:5002

### Scenario: Create Employee and Time Logger

### Step 1: Create Employee
# @name create_employee
POST {{employees_host}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "supervisorId": null
}

###
@employee_id = {{create_employee.response.body.$}}

### Step 2: Create Time Logger for Employee
POST {{time_loggers_host}}/api/time-loggers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeSpan": "02:30",
  "timeFrom": null,
  "timeTo": null,
  "employeeId": "{{employee_id}}",
  "topic": "Development work",
  "notes": "Working on REST API scenarios"
}

### Step 3: Get Employee Details
GET {{employees_host}}/api/employees/{{employee_id}}
